  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Changed\n- SDK - Updated DotNet SDK to 10.0.403\n- Tests - CanCheckOverrideTests now run the production check registrations instead of hand-copied checks (#480)\n- Tests - Private async test helpers return ValueTask instead of Task (#479)\n- IncludeAssets policy overrides and tests for Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience and Microsoft.Extensions.Telemetry.Abstractions (duplicate LoggerMessage generator, #462)\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.317\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.19.0\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Extensions to 10.0.14\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.156.2472",
